# {{ site.title }}

> Technical and personal writing by Richard Djarbeng, a software and machine learning engineer with an MSc in Electrical and Computer Engineering from Carnegie Mellon University. Topics: machine learning and computer vision, AI tools and compute, satellite and climate data, IoT and Raspberry Pi, web development, and life in Kigali and East Africa.

